  {
   "slug": "two-v-two-press-and-cover-target",
   "title": "2v2 press and cover: keep them out of the target",
   "summary": "Two defenders work as a pair, one pressing and one covering, to keep two attackers out of a target for eight seconds.",
   "format": "small_group",
   "players": [
    5,
    5,
    15
   ],
   "ages": [
    9,
    14
   ],
   "duration": [
    12,
    15
   ],
   "session_phase": "opposed",
   "intensity": "high",
   "space": [
    18,
    15
   ],
   "home_friendly": false,
   "equipment": [
    {
     "item": "cones",
     "quantity": 8
    },
    {
     "item": "bibs",
     "quantity": 2
    },
    {
     "item": "balls",
     "quantity": 10
    }
   ],
   "setup": "An area 18 m wide and 15 m deep, with a target 4 m wide and 2.5 m deep, marked with cones, in the middle of the end line. The target stands in for your penalty area. Two attackers start about 12 m from the target, two defenders between them and the target, and a server on the far line with the balls.",
   "instructions": [
    "The server plays the ball to either attacker to start.",
    "The attackers score by dribbling the ball into the target under control.",
    "The defenders score by keeping the ball out of the target for 8 seconds; the coach counts.",
    "Defenders may not stand in the target: they have to stop the ball before it gets there.",
    "Each rep lasts 20 to 30 seconds, then reset. Keep the same defending pair for 4 or 5 reps, then rotate roles."
   ],
   "coaching_points": [
    "The nearer defender presses: close down while the ball travels, then arrive side-on and show the attacker wide, away from the target.",
    "The other defender covers: stay between your own attacker and the target, close enough to step in if your partner is beaten.",
    "When the ball is passed, swap jobs: the new nearest presses, the other drops in behind to cover.",
    "Call \"press\" and \"cover\" out loud, so you both know who is doing what.",
    "Be patient: keeping them out for the 8 seconds is the win, so don't lunge in.",
    "Stop play now and then and ask: who's pressing, who's covering, and where should you be?"
   ],
   "tags": {
    "pressing": 1.0,
    "1v1_defending": 0.5,
    "communication": 0.5
   },
